      "message": "We setup in the SRC path to start the PR_Swap AMS and set NG.  Mid-way through this sequence we became SNK and when we would come back in here we would want to set the OK/Queue the message until the existing AMS completes... but that was wrong because the whole sequence is part of the multi-message AMS.  This is just allowing that condition to work",
